WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 9=

5
01:55.760 --> 01:56.310
Your Highness!

6
01:57.200 --> 01:58.209
When you went to Sigui Garden,

7
01:58.251 --> 01:59.171
didn't you take me with you?

8
01:59.950 --> 02:01.760
How could you leave without a word and forget all about me?

9
02:02.280 --> 02:03.150
And Fang Tong!

10
02:03.510 --> 02:05.040
He just drove the carriage away without a word.

11
02:05.310 --> 02:06.510
I was scared out of my wits!

12
02:12.030 --> 02:13.680
If Liu Wenji hadn't been there...

13
02:15.750 --> 02:16.680
Exactly.

14
02:17.310 --> 02:18.590
You had Liu Wenji with you.

15
02:19.310 --> 02:20.590
If I'd called you away,

16
02:20.960 --> 02:22.310
I'd have interrupted a pair of lovebirds.

17
02:24.150 --> 02:25.070
Oh, come on!

18
02:25.710 --> 02:26.710
Your Highness, don't tease me.

19
02:29.190 --> 02:30.150
Go scold Fang Tong instead.

20
02:30.840 --> 02:31.750
I want some peace and quiet.

21
02:40.750 --> 02:42.590
When I was young,

22
02:43.240 --> 02:45.150
I too was full of ambition.

23
02:45.960 --> 02:48.680
I vowed to serve a ruler who could restore our nation's glory.

24
02:49.470 --> 02:50.680
Together, ruler and ministers

25
02:51.150 --> 02:52.960
would bring prosperity back to Huai,

26
02:54.030 --> 02:55.400
with nations coming from afar to pay tribute,

27
02:55.630 --> 02:56.840
peace throughout the land,

28
02:57.280 --> 02:58.750
and happiness for the people.

29
03:00.310 --> 03:02.280
But then came the Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors,

30
03:02.630 --> 03:04.680
and the people suffered terribly.

31
03:06.030 --> 03:08.910
Years of the court's efforts were destroyed overnight.

32
03:09.800 --> 03:11.000
Though the rebellion was quelled,

33
03:11.800 --> 03:12.430
military power

34
03:13.080 --> 03:15.520
fell into Yu Cheng'an's hands.

35
03:17.150 --> 03:20.280
The eunuch faction became a swarm of leeches,

36
03:21.030 --> 03:22.590
feeding day and night

37
03:23.520 --> 03:25.030
on the lifeblood of Huai.

38
03:28.750 --> 03:29.910
Our great cause remains unfinished.

39
03:30.590 --> 03:31.800
All our efforts have come to nothing.

40
03:32.710 --> 03:33.910
Yet His Majesty and I

41
03:34.470 --> 03:36.120
have both grown old.

42
03:36.680 --> 03:37.590
At court,

43
03:38.630 --> 03:40.710
everyone has their own agenda.

44
03:41.870 --> 03:44.190
They'll stop at nothing to seize power.

45
03:44.840 --> 03:47.870
Yet no one cares about the common people.

46
04:17.680 --> 04:18.430
I concede defeat.

47
04:22.510 --> 04:23.630
You're still young.

48
04:24.000 --> 04:25.750
There's no shame in losing a few games.

49
04:26.560 --> 04:27.000
In time,

50
04:27.480 --> 04:28.720
you'll have plenty of room to improve.

51
04:29.430 --> 04:30.120
Thank you, sir.

52
04:30.680 --> 04:31.979
Don't thank me just yet.

53
04:32.021 --> 04:33.621
I'm the one asking you for a favor.

54
04:35.510 --> 04:36.040
Yan Shang,

55
04:36.800 --> 04:39.510
our nation is now ruled by traitors.

56
04:40.000 --> 04:41.070
Inside and outside the court,

57
04:41.160 --> 04:44.750
it's full of beasts masquerading as honorable men.

58
04:46.160 --> 04:46.920
Have you considered this?

59
04:47.870 --> 04:49.720
If you leave Sheng'an today,

60
04:49.950 --> 04:52.680
the same tragedies will happen again,

61
04:53.120 --> 04:54.750
over and over, countless times.

62
04:55.680 --> 04:56.120
Yan Shang,

63
04:57.270 --> 04:59.040
is that really what you want?

64
05:04.000 --> 05:04.390
No.

65
05:11.040 --> 05:11.510
Look.

66
05:13.040 --> 05:14.630
This is the gate of Sheng'an.

67
05:15.270 --> 05:16.430
Towering and imposing,

68
05:17.310 --> 05:18.160
yet when an army is defeated,

69
05:19.360 --> 05:20.680
it is as flimsy as paper.

70
05:22.430 --> 05:23.310
Beyond the gate,

71
05:23.720 --> 05:24.830
a broad avenue stretches straight ahead.

72
05:25.360 --> 05:28.160
The people live along its sides, and Taiji Palace stands at its end.

73
05:28.800 --> 05:31.360
This is the heart of Huai.

74
05:31.680 --> 05:35.310
Nowhere else can one influence the fate of the realm

75
05:35.750 --> 05:37.390
and shape the course of history like here.

76
05:41.240 --> 05:41.870
Yan Shang,

77
05:43.240 --> 05:44.680
you have extraordinary courage.

78
05:45.390 --> 05:47.390
Enough to commit murder in Sheng'an,

79
05:48.190 --> 05:50.920
right under the Emperor's nose.

80
05:52.360 --> 05:53.360
And you're remarkably patient,

81
05:54.560 --> 05:57.480
able to lie low and scheme without betraying a thing.

82
05:58.390 --> 06:00.240
So do you dare to stay

83
06:00.630 --> 06:03.800
and right the injustices of this world with your own hands?

84
06:27.870 --> 06:28.800
Chancellor Liu,

85
06:30.480 --> 06:31.600
what should I do?

86
06:36.270 --> 06:36.950
Stay.

87
06:37.920 --> 06:38.870
Rise through the ranks.

88
06:39.510 --> 06:42.070
Until you hold the power to decide who lives and dies,

89
06:42.680 --> 06:44.430
and determine the fate of Huai.

90
06:45.560 --> 06:46.070
Yan Shang,

91
06:46.830 --> 06:49.830
this road is long and treacherous.

92
06:50.830 --> 06:53.430
It may cost you your entire life,

93
06:53.870 --> 06:55.830
or even get you killed.

94
06:56.310 --> 06:58.040
Once you set foot on this path,

95
06:59.270 --> 07:00.190
no one will help you.

96
07:00.560 --> 07:02.750
You must rely on your own abilities

97
07:03.480 --> 07:06.000
to accomplish everything you aspire to.

98
07:06.360 --> 07:06.920
Succeed,

99
07:07.680 --> 07:09.750
and you'll destroy the traitors and bring peace to the realm.

100
07:10.560 --> 07:11.120
Fail,

101
07:11.560 --> 07:13.920
and you won't even have a grave to call your own.

102
07:21.310 --> 07:21.870
Well then.

103
07:22.870 --> 07:24.120
Our game is finished,

104
07:24.630 --> 07:26.160
and I've said all I have to say.

105
07:27.000 --> 07:28.630
Once you've decided which path to take,

106
07:29.510 --> 07:30.040
just go.

107
07:44.160 --> 07:45.070
Thank you, Chancellor.

108
07:47.060 --> 07:50.300
(Donghui Pavilion)

109
08:28.830 --> 08:30.040
(If my timing is right,)

110
08:31.430 --> 08:32.870
(he should be out of the city by now.)

111
08:37.270 --> 08:38.030
Your Highness! Your Highness!

112
08:39.670 --> 08:40.200
Your Highness.

113
08:40.510 --> 08:41.489
What is it now?

114
08:41.531 --> 08:42.691
Your Highness, Yan Shang is here.

115
09:08.150 --> 09:08.870
Greetings, Your Highness.

116
09:12.870 --> 09:13.720
I thought you'd left.

117
09:14.550 --> 09:15.360
Why have you come back?

118
09:17.600 --> 09:18.670
Couldn't walk any farther?

119
09:19.240 --> 09:20.270
Come to borrow my carriage?

120
09:23.080 --> 09:24.030
I won't need a carriage just yet.

121
09:24.870 --> 09:26.390
But could I trouble you for some hot water?

122
09:26.910 --> 09:27.790
I'd like to bathe and change

123
09:28.440 --> 09:29.550
before explaining myself.

124
09:32.270 --> 09:32.720
Chunhua.

125
09:33.320 --> 09:34.080
Take him to get cleaned up.

126
09:41.200 --> 09:41.630
Shang,

127
09:42.240 --> 09:43.550
did you quarrel with Her Highness again?

128
09:44.440 --> 09:45.030
I wouldn't dare.

129
09:45.600 --> 09:46.440
I'll show you to the bathhouse.

130
09:48.630 --> 09:50.080
Will you need a change of clothes?

131
09:51.910 --> 09:52.670
I'm afraid so.

132
10:31.240 --> 10:31.750
Your Highness.

133
10:33.240 --> 10:33.720
Your Highness.

134
10:34.150 --> 10:35.080
Why are you hiding?

135
10:37.720 --> 10:38.200
Your Highness.

136
10:39.320 --> 10:40.030
What is it you need?

137
10:41.360 --> 10:42.870
I'm here to bring you some clothes.

138
10:44.750 --> 10:45.120
Well,

139
10:45.870 --> 10:47.270
thank you very much, then.

140
10:49.440 --> 10:51.120
Yan Shang, you're a strange one.

141
10:51.750 --> 10:53.360
You dare kill someone right in front of me,

142
10:53.550 --> 10:55.000
but you're afraid to bathe in front of me?

143
10:55.390 --> 10:56.910
Please give me a moment of privacy, Your Highness,

144
10:57.750 --> 10:58.480
so I can get dressed.

145
11:14.840 --> 11:15.360
Yan Shang,

146
11:16.750 --> 11:17.960
how did you dare go through with it?

147
11:19.240 --> 11:20.600
There were so many people at the festival today.

148
11:21.720 --> 11:22.510
One wrong move,

149
11:23.120 --> 11:24.120
and Zhang Renjing would've survived.

150
11:25.240 --> 11:25.630
Your Highness,

151
11:26.630 --> 11:29.240
no plan in this world is completely foolproof.

152
11:30.360 --> 11:31.720
Once I'd decided he had to die,

153
11:32.550 --> 11:34.440
even if he'd escaped this time,

154
11:35.440 --> 11:36.320
there would be another chance,

155
11:36.960 --> 11:37.790
and another after that.

156
11:41.840 --> 11:42.750
As long as I'm alive,

157
11:44.000 --> 11:45.120
as long as I remain in Sheng'an,

158
11:46.240 --> 11:47.120
sooner or later,

159
11:48.270 --> 11:49.440
he'll die by my hand.

160
11:52.080 --> 11:54.080
When I brought you here from Lingnan,

161
11:54.790 --> 11:55.550
I had no idea

162
11:55.910 --> 11:57.030
you'd turn out to be

163
11:57.360 --> 11:59.480
such a vicious beast that never lets go of its prey.

164
12:00.390 --> 12:01.550
Are you afraid of me, Your Highness?

165
12:02.200 --> 12:03.000
If I were afraid of you,

166
12:03.790 --> 12:04.529
you'd already be

167
12:04.571 --> 12:06.141
locked up in the Court of Judicial Review's prison.

168
12:07.440 --> 12:08.000
Now tell me,

169
12:08.600 --> 12:09.510
why did you come back?

170
12:12.550 --> 12:13.150
I came back

171
12:13.630 --> 12:15.120
to take the imperial exams and enter official service.

172
12:15.840 --> 12:16.840
I ask for your support, Your Highness.

173
12:19.150 --> 12:21.080
Did you hit your head outside the city

174
12:21.550 --> 12:22.440
and suddenly come to your senses?

175
12:24.440 --> 12:25.120
You could say that.

176
12:35.440 --> 12:36.720
Why should I help you?

177
12:40.120 --> 12:40.840
I could

178
12:42.600 --> 12:44.240
tell you stories every night.

179
12:48.150 --> 12:48.720
Shang.

180
12:49.030 --> 12:50.390
You've got skin thicker

181
12:51.480 --> 12:53.200
than the walls of Sheng'an.

182
12:54.960 --> 12:55.960
I'm not short of company,

183
12:56.720 --> 12:57.720
nor am I afraid of nightmares.

184
12:59.120 --> 12:59.910
If that's all you have to offer,

185
13:01.270 --> 13:02.320
you won't be staying.

186
13:05.600 --> 13:07.630
I'm willing to fight the tiger alongside you.

187
13:12.960 --> 13:13.510
What did you say?

188
13:14.910 --> 13:16.150
The person you seek revenge against...

189
13:17.000 --> 13:17.720
Is it Yu Cheng'an,

190
13:18.480 --> 13:19.360
or someone else?

191
13:22.360 --> 13:23.720
I'm willing to stand by your side,

192
13:24.440 --> 13:25.320
serve as your adviser,

193
13:25.600 --> 13:26.360
and become your right-hand man.

194
13:28.360 --> 13:30.000
Together, we'll bring down those who deserve it.

195
13:33.440 --> 13:38.230
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

196
13:43.200 --> 13:44.150
Have you thought this through?

197
13:46.880 --> 13:52.470
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

198
13:58.150 --> 13:58.720
This time,

199
14:00.550 --> 14:02.000
I won't give you a chance to change your mind.

200
14:02.720 --> 14:03.270
This time,

201
14:04.840 --> 14:06.030
I'm not leaving.

202
14:08.440 --> 14:08.840
Yan Shang.

203
14:10.360 --> 14:11.000
I accept your offer.

204
14:11.960 --> 14:13.240
Do you know what I see in you?

205
14:15.750 --> 14:16.360
You have patience

206
14:16.910 --> 14:17.390
and ruthlessness.

207
14:19.360 --> 14:21.240
There are so many people I want dead.

208
14:22.240 --> 14:22.550
You

209
14:23.630 --> 14:24.720
will make a valuable ally.

210
14:27.510 --> 14:29.709
♪Not a single hour less♪

211
14:30.460 --> 14:36.900
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

212
14:37.190 --> 14:40.630
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

213
14:40.830 --> 14:44.299
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

214
14:44.540 --> 14:51.380
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

215
14:51.560 --> 14:53.199
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

216
14:53.241 --> 14:56.020
♪- May time be free of pain - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

217
14:56.036 --> 14:58.496
♪You're the only one I need♪

218
14:59.870 --> 15:00.240
Yan Shang.

219
15:02.080 --> 15:02.750
Today, you and I

220
15:03.600 --> 15:04.360
shall seal our pact by biting our arms.

221
15:06.240 --> 15:07.120
From this day forward,

222
15:08.080 --> 15:09.000
we stand or fall together,

223
15:10.030 --> 15:11.030
bound together in life and death.

224
15:28.600 --> 15:29.480
We seal our pact in blood,

225
15:30.630 --> 15:31.960
bound together in life and death.

226
15:31.960 --> 15:36.340
♪Let me hold you whenever the rain falls♪

227
15:37.940 --> 15:40.340
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

228
15:41.000 --> 15:42.000
You really bit hard!

229
15:53.150 --> 15:54.080
(Interrogation Chamber, Judicial Review) Outside the private room,

230
15:55.030 --> 15:55.870
was he the only person you saw?

231
15:56.630 --> 15:57.150
Yes.

232
15:57.440 --> 15:58.510
I wouldn't dare hide anything.

233
15:59.320 --> 16:00.870
That young man told me to fetch some wine,

234
16:01.150 --> 16:02.030
so I went.

235
16:02.600 --> 16:03.240
When I returned,

236
16:03.840 --> 16:05.120
he... he'd already disappeared.

237
16:05.840 --> 16:06.480
And what

238
16:07.240 --> 16:07.870
did he look like?

239
16:08.600 --> 16:09.670
He was a young man,

240
16:10.150 --> 16:11.320
dressed in a white robe.

241
16:22.720 --> 16:23.240
I embroidered this.

242
16:24.240 --> 16:24.600
What do you think?

243
16:28.240 --> 16:29.200
Take a closer look.

244
16:37.440 --> 16:38.510
This waterweed...

245
16:39.720 --> 16:40.360
Sharp eyes.

246
16:41.360 --> 16:42.320
Do you know who these fish represent?

247
16:44.150 --> 16:45.150
Please enlighten me, Your Highness.

248
16:47.550 --> 16:48.440
The little one

249
16:48.910 --> 16:49.630
is Yu Xianyao,

250
16:50.120 --> 16:51.150
Yu Cheng'an's adopted son.

251
16:52.720 --> 16:54.840
(Yao) He terrorizes Sheng'an,

252
16:55.200 --> 16:55.750
committing every crime imaginable.

253
16:56.840 --> 16:58.360
(That's it! Hit him!)

254
16:58.360 --> 16:59.080
(Yu Xianyao, Yu Cheng'an's Adopted Son)

255
16:59.080 --> 17:01.080
The one below is Zheng Xing, a senior palace attendant.

256
17:01.720 --> 17:02.910
But he doesn't serve the Emperor.

257
17:03.270 --> 17:03.960
He serves Yu Cheng'an.

258
17:04.920 --> 17:06.480
He's Yu Cheng'an's shadow inside the palace.

259
17:07.160 --> 17:09.270
He does all of Yu Cheng'an's dirty work.

260
17:13.540 --> 17:15.030
(Zheng Xing, Senior Palace Attendant)

261
17:15.030 --> 17:15.880
(Zheng Xing, Senior Palace Attendant) The one on the right

262
17:16.200 --> 17:18.240
is Qiu Shuo, General of Tiger Might in the Shence Army.

263
17:19.000 --> 17:20.160
When it comes to ferocity and courage,

264
17:20.590 --> 17:21.750
no one at court can match him.

265
17:22.720 --> 17:24.000
What a shame that such a formidable general

266
17:24.270 --> 17:25.680
has become Yu Cheng'an's guard dog.

267
17:26.960 --> 17:28.720
Whenever Yu Cheng'an goes out,

268
17:29.310 --> 17:31.070
Qiu Shuo personally leads the Shence Army to guard him.

269
17:31.750 --> 17:33.030
So to kill Yu Cheng'an,

270
17:33.510 --> 17:34.680
(Qiu Shuo, General, Shence Army) Qiu Shuo must die first.

271
17:35.640 --> 17:37.350
The one at the top is Wei Qiao.

272
17:38.110 --> 17:39.240
He holds no official degree,

273
17:39.720 --> 17:41.510
yet he's Yu Cheng'an's most trusted adviser.

274
17:42.480 --> 17:43.640
He's known as the Jade-Faced Fox,

275
17:44.400 --> 17:44.920
Wei Zidu.

276
17:46.820 --> 17:50.060
(Wei Qiao, Adviser to Yu Cheng'an)

277
17:55.720 --> 17:56.480
Wei Qiao...

278
17:57.640 --> 17:58.590
How is he related to Wei Shu?

279
17:58.920 --> 17:59.640
He's his older cousin.

280
18:05.030 --> 18:06.200
Then the biggest fish

281
18:06.640 --> 18:07.920
must be Yu Cheng'an himself.

282
18:21.680 --> 18:22.590
There certainly are

283
18:23.000 --> 18:23.790
a lot of people you want dead.

284
18:27.480 --> 18:28.590
If you're having second thoughts,

285
18:29.110 --> 18:29.590
it's too late.

286
18:30.440 --> 18:31.590
I'd have to kill you to keep you quiet.

287
18:33.720 --> 18:35.270
If you fear the weight of all this bloodshed,

288
18:36.350 --> 18:37.640
recite a few more sutras.

289
18:39.750 --> 18:41.030
No sacred scripture can save either of us.

290
18:41.790 --> 18:42.830
If a hell of blood awaits us,

291
18:43.750 --> 18:44.400
I'll descend into it with you.

292
18:49.270 --> 18:49.680
Your Highness,

293
18:51.200 --> 18:52.200
may I ask you something?

294
18:53.110 --> 18:54.720
If you think it'll make me angry,

295
18:55.070 --> 18:55.680
don't bother.

296
18:57.160 --> 18:58.550
Why do you trust me, Your Highness?

297
19:01.000 --> 19:01.480
Yan Shang,

298
19:01.880 --> 19:02.640
you're mistaken.

299
19:03.590 --> 19:04.830
I swore an oath of allegiance with you

300
19:05.110 --> 19:06.110
and explained this embroidery to you

301
19:07.160 --> 19:08.590
only because we can be useful to each other.

302
19:08.920 --> 19:09.680
It makes us suitable allies.

303
19:11.400 --> 19:13.590
Besides, you're a murderer now.

304
19:14.510 --> 19:16.160
Where else can you go

305
19:16.350 --> 19:17.200
but stay right here by my side?

306
19:18.790 --> 19:19.550
So,

307
19:20.270 --> 19:21.310
I don't trust you,

308
19:22.270 --> 19:23.200
and you needn't trust me either.

309
19:23.790 --> 19:24.920
If one day,

310
19:25.480 --> 19:26.350
we're both still alive

311
19:26.550 --> 19:28.030
and have accomplished everything we set out to do,

312
19:28.920 --> 19:29.480
then

313
19:30.680 --> 19:31.680
we can part on good terms.

314
19:36.750 --> 19:38.160
But for now,

315
19:39.030 --> 19:40.680
we're allies in the same boat.

316
19:41.750 --> 19:42.720
Sheng'an is full of prying eyes.

317
19:44.880 --> 19:46.830
I need to give you an official place in my household,

318
19:47.640 --> 19:48.960
so you can stay by my side

319
19:49.640 --> 19:50.510
without arousing suspicion.

320
19:54.880 --> 19:55.830
An official place?

321
19:59.920 --> 20:00.510
From now on,

322
20:01.110 --> 20:02.920
you'll officially be my male favorite.

323
20:03.960 --> 20:04.880
If you're too thin-skinned

324
20:05.270 --> 20:06.880
to endure the gossip whenever you come and go,

325
20:07.720 --> 20:08.590
you might as well quit now.

326
20:14.160 --> 20:15.550
I'm honored by your favor, Your Highness.

327
20:17.240 --> 20:17.960
Of course.

328
20:26.820 --> 20:29.220
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

329
20:29.680 --> 20:30.249
Wenji, what's wrong?

330
20:30.291 --> 20:30.661
Chunhua.

331
20:33.920 --> 20:34.200
Come here.

332
20:38.270 --> 20:39.200
Is Yan Shang here?

333
20:40.000 --> 20:40.350
Yes.

334
20:40.830 --> 20:41.510
Are you looking for him?

335
20:41.790 --> 20:42.400
I'll go get him.

336
20:43.920 --> 20:44.440
Thank goodness.

337
20:44.790 --> 20:45.920
He was right to come here.

338
20:47.720 --> 20:49.350
A group of officers from the Court of Judicial Review

339
20:49.640 --> 20:51.200
just burst into the place Yan Shang and I share

340
20:51.510 --> 20:52.550
and searched it from top to bottom.

341
20:53.400 --> 20:55.590
They said they wanted to take him in for questioning.

342
20:56.350 --> 20:57.790
I rushed to the Imperial Academy to find him,

343
20:58.240 --> 20:59.110
but he wasn't there.

344
20:59.680 --> 21:00.440
The only other place I could think of

345
21:01.030 --> 21:02.000
was the princess's residence.

346
21:03.960 --> 21:05.590
What does the Court want with Yan Shang?

347
21:06.030 --> 21:06.920
I have no idea.

348
21:08.030 --> 21:09.590
Could you please let him know?

349
21:10.790 --> 21:11.350
Don't worry.

350
21:11.680 --> 21:12.590
I'll tell him right away.

351
21:17.480 --> 21:19.440
Officers have already searched Yongshou Temple.

352
21:19.830 --> 21:21.160
They're searching everywhere for Yan Shang.

353
21:23.590 --> 21:25.590
Did they say who ordered his arrest?

354
21:26.920 --> 21:27.350
No.

355
21:31.200 --> 21:32.440
Send Fang Tong to the Court of Judicial Review.

356
21:32.830 --> 21:33.350
Tell him to find Yang Si

357
21:34.200 --> 21:35.400
and have him come see me here.

358
21:47.480 --> 21:48.400
Thank goodness you're safe.

359
21:48.790 --> 21:49.859
The murderer hadn't been caught,

360
21:49.901 --> 21:50.661
and you'd disappeared.

361
21:51.680 --> 21:52.590
Only later did I hear

362
21:52.790 --> 21:53.830
you'd taken a carriage home.

363
21:54.550 --> 21:55.110
Murderer?

364
21:56.480 --> 21:57.160
What murderer?

365
21:58.720 --> 21:59.880
The one who stabbed Zhang Renjing to death.

366
22:00.510 --> 22:01.750
Wasn't it Grand Princess Luling?

367
22:02.550 --> 22:03.000
No.

368
22:04.000 --> 22:04.960
Luling only stabbed him once.

369
22:05.590 --> 22:07.310
Someone else inflicted the fatal wounds afterward.

370
22:08.480 --> 22:09.270
I suspect...

371
22:09.830 --> 22:10.510
I was the one who stabbed him.

372
22:12.790 --> 22:13.160
What?

373
22:13.960 --> 22:15.350
I'm the one who stabbed that brute to death.

374
22:15.790 --> 22:16.960
Are you taking me to the authorities?

375
22:23.510 --> 22:24.350
Oh, I almost forgot.

376
22:25.350 --> 22:26.110
You are the authorities.

377
22:28.310 --> 22:30.270
Wanyao, this is no joking matter!

378
22:30.750 --> 22:31.680
A man's life is at stake.

379
22:46.640 --> 22:47.590
This is the knife that killed him.

380
22:53.790 --> 22:54.720
Why do you have a knife?

381
22:55.440 --> 22:56.480
Where did you buy it?

382
22:57.200 --> 22:58.350
How would I know?

383
22:59.720 --> 23:00.790
Who said it was mine?

384
23:02.030 --> 23:03.000
It belonged to that brute.

385
23:03.830 --> 23:04.880
He pulled it from his sleeve

386
23:05.640 --> 23:06.640
and lunged straight at me.

387
23:07.270 --> 23:08.200
I managed to wrestle it from him

388
23:08.640 --> 23:09.200
and stabbed him to death.

389
23:09.960 --> 23:10.680
You encountered him?

390
23:11.000 --> 23:11.550
Of course I did.

391
23:16.310 --> 23:16.680
No.

392
23:18.200 --> 23:18.550
Wanyao,

393
23:18.960 --> 23:19.440
tell me,

394
23:20.240 --> 23:21.070
how exactly did you kill him?

395
23:21.550 --> 23:22.640
Where did you stab him? How many times?

396
23:24.030 --> 23:24.480
Yang Si.

397
23:25.680 --> 23:26.640
Why don't you just put me in chains

398
23:27.310 --> 23:28.440
and torture me at the Court of Judicial Review?

399
23:29.310 --> 23:30.640
You rushed off in such a hurry.

400
23:31.590 --> 23:32.830
I was left hiding alone, terrified.

401
23:33.440 --> 23:34.830
Then that man suddenly lunged at me.

402
23:35.480 --> 23:36.880
I was lucky enough to fight back.

403
23:37.750 --> 23:39.200
How could I remember exactly how I killed him?

404
23:40.160 --> 23:42.000
I don't even know what made that brute so bold

405
23:42.510 --> 23:44.590
that he dared attack me despite his injuries.

406
23:45.440 --> 23:48.030
The coroner found alcohol and aphrodisiacs in his stomach.

407
23:50.240 --> 23:51.680
He was probably out of his mind.

408
23:57.750 --> 23:58.790
His body was covered in severe wounds.

409
23:59.400 --> 23:59.680
You...

410
24:03.240 --> 24:04.030
Where are your bloodstained clothes?

411
24:04.510 --> 24:05.720
Can you show them to me?

412
24:06.310 --> 24:06.790
I burned them.

413
24:07.590 --> 24:08.880
Why would I keep something so cursed?

414
24:16.270 --> 24:16.830
There's something else.

415
24:18.510 --> 24:19.070
Chunhua,

416
24:19.640 --> 24:21.400
fetch my cloak from the carriage.

417
24:36.590 --> 24:37.920
Why didn't you tell me?

418
24:38.070 --> 24:39.200
Because you were on official duty.

419
24:40.030 --> 24:41.160
You had criminals to catch!

420
24:42.720 --> 24:43.680
When I encountered that man,

421
24:44.070 --> 24:45.110
where were you?

422
24:46.030 --> 24:47.070
When my life was in danger,

423
24:47.680 --> 24:48.830
what else could I do but fight for my life?

424
24:49.160 --> 24:50.590
Was I supposed to count on you to save me?

425
24:53.790 --> 24:54.830
I was terrified

426
24:55.720 --> 24:56.720
and accidentally stabbed him to death.

427
24:57.270 --> 24:58.270
I didn't dare tell anyone

428
24:58.750 --> 25:00.000
and hurried into my carriage.

429
25:00.920 --> 25:01.830
Imagine the rumors if people learned that

430
25:02.550 --> 25:04.680
the man who assaulted Grand Princess Luling had come after me too.

431
25:05.160 --> 25:06.160
What would they say about me?

432
25:11.720 --> 25:12.400
But then again,

433
25:14.070 --> 25:15.750
I'm hardly a model of chastity.

434
25:17.830 --> 25:19.110
My reputation as a woman

435
25:19.880 --> 25:20.830
could hardly get any worse.

436
25:21.400 --> 25:22.329
No, that's not...

437
25:22.371 --> 25:23.021
Not what?

438
25:24.510 --> 25:25.750
Not a widow returned from a marriage far away?

439
25:26.680 --> 25:27.200
Or

440
25:28.680 --> 25:29.960
not a murderer?

441
25:37.920 --> 25:38.510
Back then,

442
25:38.880 --> 25:40.200
I actually left you alone.

443
25:43.400 --> 25:43.790
Come on.

444
25:45.030 --> 25:45.769
Let's go to the Court of Judicial Review together.

445
25:45.811 --> 25:46.181
No!

446
25:46.830 --> 25:47.240
Wanyao.

447
25:47.680 --> 25:48.680
I'll pretend I never came here today.

448
25:49.550 --> 25:51.030
Other than me,

449
25:51.400 --> 25:52.750
you mustn't tell another soul.

450
25:53.240 --> 25:53.880
Of course.

451
25:54.200 --> 25:55.160
I'm not a fool.

452
25:57.070 --> 25:57.790
That brute

453
25:58.160 --> 25:59.480
was a captain in the Shence Army,

454
26:00.550 --> 26:02.240
an old subordinate Yu Cheng'an recently brought to the capital.

455
26:03.310 --> 26:05.550
I'm afraid the Shence Army won't let this go.

456
26:06.480 --> 26:06.920
Don't worry.

457
26:07.270 --> 26:08.000
I'll find a way.

458
26:13.440 --> 26:14.790
So he was one of Yu Cheng'an's men.

459
26:18.000 --> 26:18.590
I have my own way.

460
26:19.160 --> 26:20.350
No need to trouble you, Assessor Yang.

461
26:21.510 --> 26:22.160
What way?

462
26:25.270 --> 26:25.920
I won't see you out.

463
27:07.480 --> 27:07.830
Your Highness.

464
27:19.680 --> 27:21.000
That childhood sweetheart of yours...

465
27:23.310 --> 27:25.030
You've only just become my male favorite,

466
27:26.110 --> 27:27.200
and you're already jealous?

467
27:28.160 --> 27:28.790
Just now,

468
27:29.830 --> 27:30.550
when he saw me,

469
27:31.310 --> 27:32.750
he looked rather strange.

470
27:34.240 --> 27:35.030
He's now

471
27:35.830 --> 27:37.000
an assessor at the Court of Judicial Review.

472
27:37.750 --> 27:38.920
He's investigating Zhang Renjing's murder.

473
27:43.480 --> 27:44.480
Don't worry.

474
27:44.830 --> 27:46.550
You belong to me now.

475
27:47.110 --> 27:48.160
Of course I'll protect you.

476
27:49.160 --> 27:49.960
This matter

477
27:50.510 --> 27:51.480
is no longer your concern.

478
27:53.550 --> 27:54.400
Still, it's a murder case.

479
27:54.880 --> 27:55.510
For the next few days,

480
27:56.000 --> 27:56.920
don't leave the residence.

481
27:58.720 --> 28:00.310
If someone recognizes your face,

482
28:00.750 --> 28:02.680
they might remember something that incriminates you.

483
28:03.640 --> 28:03.960
Also,

484
28:05.310 --> 28:06.920
tell me exactly what happened,

485
28:07.510 --> 28:10.440
from beginning to end. Don't leave out a single detail.

486
28:11.680 --> 28:12.720
Then stay here.

487
28:13.920 --> 28:14.720
As for me,

488
28:16.070 --> 28:17.110
I have a relative to visit.

489
28:23.000 --> 28:24.440
By the time I came to my senses,

490
28:26.510 --> 28:28.510
the man was already lying on the ground,

491
28:29.680 --> 28:31.830
dead from my stab wounds.

492
28:33.270 --> 28:34.000
Aunt.

493
28:35.000 --> 28:36.000
Why must you and I

494
28:36.830 --> 28:39.200
suffer such terrible misfortunes?

495
28:40.640 --> 28:41.880
He wasn't just brazen.

496
28:42.790 --> 28:43.720
He must've been insane!

497
28:45.550 --> 28:47.400
I heard from the court officials

498
28:49.000 --> 28:50.790
that he'd taken a large dose of aphrodisiacs

499
28:51.750 --> 28:53.550
and was terribly drunk.

500
28:54.000 --> 28:55.270
He'd lost his senses,

501
28:55.480 --> 28:57.440
which is why he stumbled into the private room.

502
28:57.960 --> 28:58.510
Aunt,

503
28:59.030 --> 29:01.000
what if word of this gets out?

504
29:02.110 --> 29:03.400
So what if it does?

505
29:04.070 --> 29:05.310
You think I'm afraid of gossip?

506
29:06.310 --> 29:06.750
But...

507
29:08.070 --> 29:08.880
His wounds...

508
29:09.680 --> 29:11.510
We were the ones who stabbed him.

509
29:12.240 --> 29:13.400
After all,

510
29:14.440 --> 29:16.270
a man is dead!

511
29:17.590 --> 29:18.350
Aunt!

512
29:18.830 --> 29:21.790
I've never killed anyone before!

513
29:23.400 --> 29:24.440
There, there.

514
29:24.750 --> 29:26.440
That's enough, Wanyao.

515
29:27.030 --> 29:28.400
Stop crying.

516
29:30.030 --> 29:31.030
You're a princess.

517
29:31.640 --> 29:32.680
Have some dignity.

518
29:34.000 --> 29:35.830
I say you did well to kill him.

519
29:36.550 --> 29:37.550
In fact, I should thank you

520
29:37.920 --> 29:39.350
for avenging the insult I suffered.

521
29:40.920 --> 29:42.510
I only wish I'd been there.

522
29:42.720 --> 29:44.590
I'd have hacked him to pieces myself!

523
29:47.070 --> 29:48.440
Hearing you say that, Aunt,

524
29:49.160 --> 29:49.880
I suddenly

525
29:50.720 --> 29:52.200
feel so much better.

526
29:54.030 --> 29:56.270
Come to think of it, you and I

527
29:56.880 --> 29:58.510
have rid the people of a menace.

528
29:59.590 --> 30:00.920
Exactly.

529
30:05.400 --> 30:06.240
But...

530
30:09.960 --> 30:10.680
But...

531
30:11.350 --> 30:13.000
I heard from the court officials

532
30:14.160 --> 30:14.790
that the man

533
30:15.550 --> 30:17.240
was one of Lord Yu's subordinates.

534
30:18.830 --> 30:19.640
Aunt,

535
30:20.480 --> 30:22.270
won't that make things difficult?

536
30:23.720 --> 30:24.440
Wanyao,

537
30:25.510 --> 30:27.200
you really underestimate me.

538
30:27.790 --> 30:28.720
What's the big deal?

539
30:30.270 --> 30:31.200
So what if I killed

540
30:31.680 --> 30:33.070
a mere captain today?

541
30:33.480 --> 30:35.750
Even if I killed a general tomorrow,

542
30:36.750 --> 30:37.920
what of it?

543
30:46.680 --> 30:47.510
Wanyao claims

544
30:48.200 --> 30:49.240
she killed Zhang Renjing.

545
30:50.750 --> 30:51.200
Do you believe her?

546
30:53.680 --> 30:55.350
But she had the murder weapon and bloodstained clothes.

547
30:56.270 --> 30:56.880
You don't believe her either,

548
30:57.830 --> 30:58.160
do you?

549
30:59.350 --> 31:00.480
No matter how reckless Zhang Renjing was,

550
31:01.030 --> 31:01.920
or how drunk and drugged he was,

551
31:02.680 --> 31:03.550
he was still a seasoned soldier

552
31:03.960 --> 31:05.440
who'd survived years of fighting.

553
31:06.310 --> 31:07.480
He slept with one eye open.

554
31:08.790 --> 31:09.960
He was wounded and fleeing for his life.

555
31:10.550 --> 31:11.489
I refuse to believe he'd be

556
31:11.531 --> 31:13.331
so blinded by lust that he'd act so recklessly.

557
31:14.440 --> 31:15.070
And Wanyao

558
31:15.790 --> 31:16.920
isn't someone who would commit murder.

559
31:18.640 --> 31:19.510
It's not that she lacks courage.

560
31:20.270 --> 31:21.480
But murder is a serious matter,

561
31:22.160 --> 31:23.240
and she'd never willingly

562
31:23.790 --> 31:25.030
get herself tangled up in such trouble.

563
31:26.240 --> 31:26.960
Then why would she...

564
31:28.030 --> 31:29.160
That's the real question.

565
31:31.000 --> 31:31.790
We need to figure out

566
31:32.880 --> 31:34.070
why she's lying.

567
31:36.030 --> 31:36.920
Or rather,

568
31:38.550 --> 31:40.000
who exactly is she trying to protect?

569
31:46.960 --> 31:47.270
Your Highness.

570
31:48.270 --> 31:48.640
Your Highness.

571
31:50.400 --> 31:50.750
Get out.

572
31:51.270 --> 31:51.640
Get out.

573
31:53.510 --> 31:53.960
Your Highness.

574
31:55.350 --> 31:55.750
I...

575
31:56.350 --> 31:56.830
I deserve punishment.

576
31:57.960 --> 31:59.640
Thank goodness you weren't hurt.

577
32:02.960 --> 32:04.240
I wasn't physically hurt,

578
32:05.160 --> 32:06.590
but I was frightened!

579
32:06.680 --> 32:08.030
And utterly disgusted!

580
32:08.640 --> 32:09.160
You...

581
32:09.350 --> 32:11.200
You certainly promoted a fine subordinate!

582
32:12.110 --> 32:12.510
I...

583
32:13.000 --> 32:13.960
I deserve to die a thousand deaths!

584
32:37.110 --> 32:37.590
I want some tea.

585
32:41.480 --> 32:41.790
Yes.

586
32:43.440 --> 32:43.750
Right away.

587
33:15.790 --> 33:16.979
Hurry up!

588
33:17.021 --> 33:17.461
Yes.

589
33:23.480 --> 33:27.350
I truly misjudged the man,

590
33:27.830 --> 33:29.350
and you suffered because of it.

591
33:32.550 --> 33:34.200
Wanyao told me today

592
33:34.510 --> 33:35.200
that the dead man's body

593
33:35.750 --> 33:37.510
is still being held by the Court of Judicial Review,

594
33:37.830 --> 33:38.880
while they investigate every little thing.

595
33:41.070 --> 33:42.880
Princess Danyang is very thoughtful indeed.

596
33:44.160 --> 33:44.640
Rest assured.

597
33:45.000 --> 33:46.459
I'll send someone to the Court tomorrow...

598
33:46.501 --> 33:47.221
Tomorrow?

599
33:48.830 --> 33:49.240
Tonight!

600
33:50.720 --> 33:51.200
Right now!

601
33:51.790 --> 33:52.769
I'll send someone to the court immediately

602
33:52.811 --> 33:54.051
and have that corpse brought back.

603
33:54.440 --> 33:55.400
Bring it back?

604
33:58.270 --> 33:59.160
Grind its bones to dust and scatter the ashes?

605
34:00.110 --> 34:01.240
Yes! Grind its bones to dust!

606
34:01.550 --> 34:02.310
I promise you,

607
34:02.720 --> 34:03.960
this case will be closed.

608
34:04.160 --> 34:04.859
From now on,

609
34:04.901 --> 34:06.811
no one will ever mention this matter to you again

610
34:07.790 --> 34:08.550
or cause you any distress.

611
34:14.840 --> 34:15.440
I'll be leaving, then.

612
34:16.760 --> 34:17.480
Leaving so soon?

613
34:20.360 --> 34:21.400
Lord Yu, you're a busy man.

614
34:22.000 --> 34:23.590
Who am I to impose on you?

615
34:25.280 --> 34:25.710
Your Highness,

616
34:26.920 --> 34:28.920
why must you speak to me like that?

617
34:45.230 --> 34:45.590
Oh, one more thing.

618
34:46.230 --> 34:47.920
The imperial exams are in a few days.

619
34:48.760 --> 34:50.230
Once the top three candidates are decided,

620
34:50.400 --> 34:51.360
before the results are posted,

621
34:52.400 --> 34:53.400
I want to see the list first.

622
34:54.760 --> 34:57.150
Since when have you cared about selecting officials for the court?

623
34:58.760 --> 35:00.360
That's hardly what interests me!

624
35:02.110 --> 35:03.110
Why are you following me?

625
35:03.440 --> 35:04.920
Go grind those bones to dust!

626
35:06.000 --> 35:06.400
Yes.

627
35:08.630 --> 35:10.070
Farewell, Your Highness!

628
35:52.360 --> 35:53.000
Careful, Your Highness.

629
35:54.400 --> 35:55.230
You should sit farther inside.

630
35:56.550 --> 35:57.800
We're on the grounds of my residence.

631
35:58.800 --> 36:01.320
I've ridden this little boat countless times.

632
36:02.550 --> 36:04.840
I often take it out just to drift around.

633
36:05.360 --> 36:05.960
Don't worry.

634
36:22.540 --> 36:29.530
♪Playing out life's game, forever by your side; Innocent years drift by♪

635
36:31.260 --> 36:38.080
♪I thought time might stand still forever at that crossroads♪

636
36:39.620 --> 36:46.610
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade; weathering life's rise and fall♪

637
36:47.870 --> 36:54.820
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness is starlight caught in your eyes♪

638
37:21.800 --> 37:22.190
Your Highness.

639
37:23.000 --> 37:23.590
Where are we?

640
37:24.880 --> 37:26.190
If you're going out this late,

641
37:26.800 --> 37:27.800
you should bring more guards.

642
37:28.400 --> 37:29.960
Stop worrying over nothing.

643
37:30.360 --> 37:31.280
There's nobody around.

644
38:03.000 --> 38:03.440
Not bad.

645
38:04.280 --> 38:05.320
It's a little small,

646
38:05.960 --> 38:07.320
but it's been kept quite clean.

647
38:09.030 --> 38:10.800
This place is connected to your residence by waterway.

648
38:11.400 --> 38:12.480
Is it another of your private properties?

649
38:14.000 --> 38:14.880
It used to be mine.

650
38:15.400 --> 38:16.760
Now it's yours.

651
38:18.110 --> 38:19.000
Isn't that only natural?

652
38:20.320 --> 38:21.110
To be frank,

653
38:21.440 --> 38:22.360
a residence this large

654
38:23.030 --> 38:24.880
requires servants and considerable upkeep.

655
38:25.760 --> 38:26.480
I can't afford...

656
38:27.150 --> 38:27.710
Yan Shang.

657
38:28.230 --> 38:30.110
I've never seen anyone so poor yet bold enough to come to the capital,

658
38:30.480 --> 38:31.630
and so shameless

659
38:31.960 --> 38:32.840
on top of that.

660
38:34.670 --> 38:35.360
You're too kind, Your Highness.

661
38:35.920 --> 38:36.510
That's easily solved.

662
38:37.190 --> 38:38.280
I have plenty of servants.

663
38:38.710 --> 38:39.710
I'll lend you a few.

664
38:40.880 --> 38:41.320
But...

665
38:42.480 --> 38:43.630
remember to write me an IOU.

666
38:47.960 --> 38:48.800
Anything more you want to say?

667
38:53.760 --> 38:54.840
Yan Shang, do you want it or not?

668
38:58.880 --> 38:59.630
If I say no,

669
39:00.030 --> 39:01.280
I'm afraid you'll slap me again.

670
39:01.880 --> 39:03.230
I'll speak to Wenji tomorrow

671
39:03.550 --> 39:04.800
and ask him to bring my belongings here.

672
39:05.840 --> 39:06.440
Thank you, Your Highness.

673
39:07.190 --> 39:09.000
I'll probably need to borrow from you a lot.

674
39:09.800 --> 39:11.590
I hope you'll be generous with the repayment deadlines.

675
39:13.190 --> 39:15.920
Didn't you say you had no way to repay me?

676
39:17.190 --> 39:19.440
Looking you over,

677
39:20.550 --> 39:21.710
that mouth is your only real asset.

678
39:22.360 --> 39:22.840
Make sure

679
39:23.360 --> 39:24.360
you put it to good use.

680
39:40.840 --> 39:41.670
What I mean is,

681
39:42.400 --> 39:43.569
say more sweet things

682
39:43.611 --> 39:44.651
and tell interesting stories.

683
40:05.510 --> 40:06.630
I rarely visit this residence.

684
40:07.840 --> 40:08.630
Looking at it tonight,

685
40:09.440 --> 40:10.960
it feels so cold and desolate.

686
40:12.440 --> 40:13.440
If it makes you uncomfortable,

687
40:13.880 --> 40:14.960
I'll have someone come tomorrow

688
40:15.670 --> 40:16.590
to cut down all these trees

689
40:17.150 --> 40:17.760
and replace them with flowers.

690
40:18.510 --> 40:19.440
There's no need, Your Highness.

691
40:20.230 --> 40:21.280
I like this residence very much.

692
40:22.110 --> 40:23.030
Pine breezes, moonlit shadows...

693
40:23.480 --> 40:24.230
A sight of cool serenity.

694
40:25.710 --> 40:26.630
Sheng'an is such a bustling city.

695
40:27.440 --> 40:28.840
It's rare to find such a peaceful retreat.

696
40:35.110 --> 40:35.480
Your Highness.

697
40:37.960 --> 40:38.320
Your Highness.

698
40:40.800 --> 40:43.400
The former owner of this residence rose to the rank of chancellor,

699
40:44.760 --> 40:46.000
but he angered Yu Cheng'an

700
40:46.510 --> 40:47.000
and was eventually

701
40:47.880 --> 40:48.880
cut in half and left on public display.

702
40:51.590 --> 40:52.760
No wonder it's so chilling here.

703
40:53.360 --> 40:53.920
Turns out

704
40:54.630 --> 40:55.670
it's a haunted house.

705
40:59.070 --> 40:59.510
Scared?

706
41:02.510 --> 41:03.630
Since Lord Yu came to power,

707
41:04.320 --> 41:06.480
he's purged court officials time and again.

708
41:07.760 --> 41:09.760
Of all the official residences in Sheng'an,

709
41:10.000 --> 41:11.190
which hasn't changed hands several times?

710
41:11.960 --> 41:12.510
Indeed.

711
41:12.920 --> 41:14.030
The highest-ranking officials,

712
41:14.360 --> 41:15.230
the great noble families,

713
41:15.760 --> 41:16.630
even members of the royal family...

714
41:17.320 --> 41:18.320
In Yu Cheng'an's eyes,

715
41:19.000 --> 41:20.280
they're nothing but meat on a chopping block.

716
41:21.710 --> 41:22.320
As for me,

717
41:24.440 --> 41:25.320
I doubt he's even

718
41:25.710 --> 41:26.800
given me a second thought.

719
41:31.510 --> 41:32.440
What are you trying to tell me, Your Highness?

720
41:35.710 --> 41:36.110
Yan Shang,

721
41:37.880 --> 41:39.110
I know what I want to accomplish.

722
41:40.760 --> 41:41.320
But...

723
41:42.280 --> 41:43.510
I don't know where to begin.

724
41:45.000 --> 41:46.070
Our strength is vastly unequal.

725
41:47.150 --> 41:48.920
That tiger sits high upon the mountain.

726
41:49.320 --> 41:50.510
I can't even get close to him.

727
41:51.360 --> 41:51.979
I don't want to pretend

728
41:52.021 --> 41:53.501
I have everything figured out and deceive you.

729
41:54.800 --> 41:56.280
From now on, we stand or fall together.

730
41:57.320 --> 41:58.710
I owe you the truth.

731
42:02.480 --> 42:03.280
Thank you, Your Highness,

732
42:03.920 --> 42:05.070
for being honest with me.

733
42:07.030 --> 42:08.110
I took you on as my adviser

734
42:08.670 --> 42:10.550
precisely so you could give me advice.

735
42:14.510 --> 42:14.920
Your Highness,

736
42:16.480 --> 42:18.110
then let me tell you another story.

737
42:20.110 --> 42:20.440
All right.

738
42:24.340 --> 42:28.780
(Next Episode Preview)

739
42:29.190 --> 42:30.480
Your imperial exams are tomorrow.

740
42:30.800 --> 42:31.400
Are you nervous?

741
42:31.800 --> 42:33.150
That's not why I came here.

742
42:33.880 --> 42:34.880
Whether I pass or fail,

743
42:35.400 --> 42:35.960
it doesn't matter.

744
42:36.190 --> 42:37.960
Then how do you plan to make a living in Sheng'an?

745
42:40.030 --> 42:42.320
By being your male favorite, of course.

746
42:45.280 --> 42:48.573
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

747
42:51.258 --> 42:56.174
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

748
42:58.368 --> 43:04.213
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

749
43:04.713 --> 43:09.939
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

750
43:12.708 --> 43:17.499
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

751
43:18.335 --> 43:24.414
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

752
43:26.215 --> 43:29.365
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

753
43:29.365 --> 43:31.013
♪Burning bright as a song♪

754
43:31.065 --> 43:34.789
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

755
43:35.167 --> 43:39.833
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

756
43:40.452 --> 43:44.493
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

757
43:44.984 --> 43:47.099
♪Not a single hour less♪

758
43:47.139 --> 43:54.085
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

759
43:54.848 --> 43:58.301
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

760
43:58.481 --> 44:01.626
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

761
44:02.065 --> 44:08.702
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

762
44:09.099 --> 44:11.137
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

763
44:11.137 --> 44:13.613
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

764
44:13.651 --> 44:16.120
♪You're the only one I need♪

765
44:16.324 --> 44:23.211
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

766
44:23.523 --> 44:26.794
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

767
44:27.099 --> 44:30.272
♪My last untouched innocence♪

768
44:30.596 --> 44:34.022
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

769
44:34.255 --> 44:37.480
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

770
44:37.811 --> 44:44.607
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

771
44:44.976 --> 44:47.038
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

772
44:47.039 --> 44:49.542
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

773
44:49.589 --> 44:51.927
♪You're the only one I need♪

774
44:52.158 --> 44:58.993
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

775
44:59.342 --> 45:00.960
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

776
45:01.090 --> 45:02.886
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

777
45:03.243 --> 45:06.260
♪You're the only one I need♪

778
45:06.300 --> 45:07.627
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
